OL,4,BScotland sink Ireland as both reach    
OL,5,BSuper Six phase                        
OL,6,GICC Women's Emerging Nations Trophy    
OL,8,FIreland 71 (19.3 overs): Lewis 20;     
OL,9,FGordon 4-4, Maqsood 3-15               
OL,11,FScotland 72-2 (8.3 overs): Carter 30,  
OL,12,FFraser 21                              
OL,14,FScotland win by eight wickets          
OL,16,FScotland's bowlers made short work of  
OL,17,FIreland in a comfortable eight-wicket  
OL,18,Fvictory as both teams progressed to    
OL,19,Fthe Super Six stage at the Women's     
OL,20,FEmerging Nations Trophy in Dubai.      
